{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "斜率 2 的几何与变化率含义",
    "goals": [
      "理解直线 y=2x+1 中斜率 2 的直观含义：x 每增加 1，y 对应增加 2",
      "通过点在直线上的移动，掌握斜率计算公式 Δy/Δx = 2"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "遵从学生偏好：先明确给出结论，再展开几何解释",
        "复用熟悉的‘山路坡度’比喻，建立水平位移与垂直变化的直观对应",
        "紧凑精炼，单节完成直观感知与计算检验"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 0,
        "min": -2,
        "max": 3,
        "label": "点A横坐标",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.025
        }
      },
      {
        "as": "number_02",
        "initial": 1,
        "min": -1,
        "max": 4,
        "label": "点B横坐标",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.025
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-01-task-01",
        "prompt": "将点 A 移动到 x = 1，观察此时点 A(1, 3) 与点 B(2, 5) 之间的坡度关系。",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "向右拖动点 A 的滑块，将数值设为 1。",
          "当 x 从 1 变到 2 时，水平变化量 Δx 是 1，看看垂直高度 y 从 3 变到了几？"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "太棒了！A 变成了 (1,3)，B 是 (2,5)，高度差是 2，水平差是 1，斜率依然是 2！",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": 1,
          "tolerance": 0.0125
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "直接阐明斜率 2 的核心含义，并通过两点移动观察水平变化与垂直变化的比值",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "先说结论：斜率 2 的意思就是，沿着这条直线向右每走 1 个单位，高度就往上升高 2 个单位。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "k = \\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x} = \\frac{2}{1} = 2"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "斜率 2 的含义",
                "items": [
                  "结论：x 每增加 1，y 就增加 2",
                  "山路比喻：向右走 1 步，向上抬升 2 格",
                  "比值固定：垂直变化量除以水平变化量恒等于 2"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "我们把这条直线想象成一段山路。看看坐标系里的直线 y=2x+1，此时点 A 在 x=0 处，对应高度是 1；点 B 在 x=1 处，对应高度是 3。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "函数图像",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -2,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -5,
                    "max": 15,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((2)*(x))+(1)",
                    "label": "y=2x+1"
                  }
                ],
                "points": [
                  {
                    "as": "moving-point",
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 1,
                    "label": "A"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "second-point",
                    "x": 1,
                    "y": 3,
                    "label": "B"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "moving-point.x",
                    "expression": "number_01"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "moving-point.y",
                    "expression": "((2)*(number_01))+(1)"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "second-point.x",
                    "expression": "number_02"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "second-point.y",
                    "expression": "((2)*(number_02))+(1)"
                  }
                ],
                "measurement": "secant"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "观察直线上的两点 A(0,1) 和 B(1,3)",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "从 A 走到 B，水平方向向右前进了 1 格，也就是 Δx=1；垂直方向向上攀升了 2 格，也就是 Δy=2。它们的比值就是 2 除以 1，正好是 2！",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "如果我们迈步更大一点，把点 B 移动到 x=2 看看。从 A 到 B 水平走了 2 格，垂直方向就足足上升了 4 格。注意看算式：4 除以 2，比值依然稳稳的是 2。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_02",
              "value": 2,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "before_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-05",
          "say": "不管在直线上取哪两点，高度变化量 Δy 永远是底边水平距离 Δx 的 2 倍。现在轮到你试一试了，把点 A 移动到 x=1，亲手验证一下这个台阶比例吧！",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "在直线 y=2x+1 中，斜率 2 代表‘变化率’：沿着直线往右走 1 个单位，高度必然上升 2 个单位，始终保持 Δy/Δx = 2。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
